# both under active live development outside this session.
#
# 2026-09-29 RESYNC #5. ccare_progress_emitter NODE REMOVED from the live
# graph too (process v1.21.0 -> v1.24.0) -- it now joins ccare_data_freshness_check_py,
# ccare_action_recommender, and ccare_response_renderer as orphaned-but-still-live.
# Live bound-task count dropped 8 -> 7. Confirmed by diffing
# process.tasks[].bound_task against the full /admin/api/tasks list AND
# local files, not assumed from the version bump alone.
#
# 2026-09-28 RESYNC #4. ccare_response_renderer NODE REMOVED from the live
# graph (process v1.19.7 -> v1.21.0) -- joined the orphaned-but-live set.
# ==============================================================================

