  notes: >-
    Live process version 1.19.7. New as of this resync: ccare_progress_emitter
    (llm, no tools) runs after provider/session validation and before data
    collection, emitting one interim provider-safe acknowledgement sentence
    keyed off turnRequest.action/subFilter -- the final answer still comes
    only from ccare_response_formatter + ccare_response_renderer downstream.
    Freshness remains inside ccare_data_collection; session_gate has no
    cached edge.

